<section class="ac-public-hero" data-ac-page-section="public-home">
  <p class="ac-public-eyebrow">Healthcare operations platform</p>
  <h1>Modern clinic operations for teams in Zambia</h1>
  <p class="ac-public-lede">ActiveClinic helps healthcare organisations manage day-to-day clinic work and offer a public presence for patients — without promising features your clinic has not enabled.</p>
  <p class="ac-public-actions">
    <a class="ac-btn ac-btn--primary" href="/clinics">Find a clinic</a>
    <a class="ac-btn ac-btn--secondary" href="/register-clinic">Register your clinic</a>
    <a class="ac-btn ac-btn--ghost" href="/solutions">Explore solutions</a>
  </p>
</section>

<section class="ac-public-section ac-public-section--cta" data-ac-home-section="discovery">
  <div class="ac-public-cta-card">
    <h2>Discover participating clinics</h2>
    <p>Browse clinics that have chosen to publish a public directory listing. Each clinic controls its own services, booking settings, and contact details.</p>
    <a class="ac-btn ac-btn--primary" href="/clinics">Browse clinic directory</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ac-public-section" data-ac-home-section="patient-benefits">
  <h2>For patients and families</h2>
  <div class="ac-capability-grid">
    <article class="ac-capability-card">
      <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
      <h3>Find clinic information</h3>
      <p>Search published clinics by name or location. Only clinics that opt in appear in the directory.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="ac-capability-card">
      <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
      <h3>Request an appointment</h3>
      <p>Submit a booking request where the clinic has enabled it. Requests are reviewed by clinic staff — not instant confirmations.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="ac-capability-card">
      <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--pilot">Pilot</span>
      <h3>Track booking requests</h3>
      <p>Use your booking link to check status or request changes when a clinic provides one. No patient portal login required for basic lookup.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ac-public-section ac-public-section--alt" data-ac-home-section="clinic-benefits">
  <h2>For clinics and hospitals</h2>
  <div class="ac-capability-grid">
    <article class="ac-capability-card">
      <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
      <h3>Operations foundation</h3>
      <p>Patients, appointments, reception workflows, and organisation settings for enrolled teams — accessed securely after staff sign-in.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="ac-capability-card">
      <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
      <h3>Public clinic website</h3>
      <p>Publish services, doctors, and contact information when your organisation is ready. You decide what appears publicly.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="ac-capability-card">
      <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
      <h3>Reviewed onboarding</h3>
      <p>Registration applications are reviewed by the ActiveClinic team. Submitting an application does not auto-publish your clinic.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ac-public-section" data-ac-home-section="platform-capabilities">
  <h2>Platform capabilities</h2>
  <div class="ac-capability-grid ac-capability-grid--four">
    <article class="ac-capability-card ac-capability-card--compact">
      <h3>Scheduling requests</h3>
      <p>Patients request visits; clinics confirm availability on their own schedule. No live slot guarantees on the public site.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="ac-capability-card ac-capability-card--compact">
      <h3>Secure data handling</h3>
      <p>Clinical work stays in the authenticated ActiveClinic application. The public website shows only what each clinic publishes.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="ac-capability-card ac-capability-card--compact">
      <h3>Reliable performance</h3>
      <p>Built on GetPro infrastructure with responsive layouts for desktop and mobile clinic discovery.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="ac-capability-card ac-capability-card--compact">
      <h3>Zambia-first</h3>
      <p>Phone formats, provinces, and timezone defaults designed for Zambian healthcare organisations, with room to grow.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ac-public-section ac-public-privacy-note" data-ac-home-section="privacy">
  <h2>Privacy and honesty</h2>
  <p>ActiveClinic does not expose medical records on this public website. We do not claim real-time appointment availability, automated SMS delivery, or instant clinic provisioning. Capabilities marked <strong>Pilot</strong> or <strong>Planned</strong> on our solutions pages are labelled clearly.</p>
  <p><a href="/about">Read more about ActiveClinic</a></p>
</section>

